OPEN_QUESTION TheRebaseOfAMilestoneBranchUnderItsOpenWaves
	QUESTION "when the integration branch of a milestone is rebased onto main before a wave starts"
		+ "while other waves of the milestone are open, cut from the branch before the rebase, what"
		+ "becomes of those waves: their branches rebased onto the new base too, the rebase waited"
		+ "for until they are merged, or something else?"
	STATUS closed
	BLOCKS @TASK.B214
	RATIONALE "the user ruled the rebase over the merge, « je préfère rebase que merge », which"
		+ "rewrites the base of every wave branch cut from the milestone branch; several waves of a"
		+ "project may be open at once under"
		+ "@DECISION.AWaveIsABatchOfTasksStartedTogetherAndLivesInTheLedgerAlone, and the rebase of"
		+ "a task branch onto its wave branch, @TASK.B210, does not reach a wave branch"
		REF @DECISION.AWaveIsABatchOfTasksStartedTogetherAndLivesInTheLedgerAlone
